:: OC Luca Eating With 1 [nobr]

/* Intro */
Across the cafeteria, you spot <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> sitting at a mostly empty table. He is downing a sandwich while eyeing a very delicious and decadent brownie sitting atop a neatly folded napkin in his lunchbox. His eyes are like that of a hunter lusting after pray. Curious, you walk over and sit down. <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Luca",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Smile",
            Blush: 1,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Mmmppfft!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> says, his mouth full, before he quickly swallows. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry, haha. Hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! How’s your day going?”</span> You shrug, say it’s going fine, and begin to chat with him. Though you can’t help but notice that he is eating in a hurry, swiftly downing his sandwich, carrots, and everything else in his lunchbox as his eyes keep flickering to the brownie. Eventually, you have to ask what he’s doing. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“My mom gave me some of the left-over brownies for my lunch, they are SOOOO GOOOD!”</span> He replies, mouth watering as he eyes the shining treat. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But dumb <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> got mad last time I only brought deserts and candy for lunch, so he said I have to eat everything else first or else he’ll give me detention.”</span> Sure enough, peeking past <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>, you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> glancing over and eyeing the boy. You know it is probably for his best, but you can imagine this is a pain <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> can only barely endure. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But I keep thinking about how it’s going to taste and it smells so good and- AH! I can hardly take it anymore!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> quickly begins to devour the rest of his lunch as fast as he can to get his tasty treat. This goes poorly, as expected, and he starts to feel a little sick before he even gets the chance to eat his desert. <span style="color:lightgreen">Man, that boy really loves his sweets!</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Luca" 1 1>>
<br>
<<include "School Lunch">>
<<set $FriendLunch to 1>>

:: OC Luca Eating With 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
You are looking for a spot to eat when your eyes catch a curious sight. <span style="color:yellow">A boy is hunched under one of the far tables downing his lunch out of sight from everyone else. It takes you a minute to realize it is <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>! What on earth is he doing?</span> Unable to hold in your curiosity, you walk over to the table he is under and poke your head down. <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Luca",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> jumps upon seeing you, hitting his head on the table, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oooouucchh.”</span> He groans and rubs his head as you ask him what is going on. Why is he eating under the table? <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Ssshhhhh!!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> shushes you, peeking his head out before pulling you under the table. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Here, check this out!”</span> <span style="color:lightgreen">He opens his lunchbox to reveal it is full to the brim with candies, muffins, and other sweet treats. Just the smell alone gives you a sugar-high!</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sweet, right?”</span> He laughs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Mom was too busy to pack my lunch, so she let me. Packed it full of the good stuff!”</spaN> He pats the lunchbox happily before glaring off towards the rest of the school, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“But last time I did something like this, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Chang</span> caught me and called my mom. She beat my butt and made me eat nothing but vegetables for, like, a whole week! I nearly died!”</span> You get the feeling the only thing that will kill him is all the sweets he is eating, but don’t mention that part. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“So, I’m under cover. Gotta get this down before anyone spots me. Here-“</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> hands you a small handful of sweets, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Do me a favor, sit over here to block their line of sight. Consider it a bribe.”</span> He gives a cute smile that you can’t help but laugh at. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:lightgreen">Despite knowing that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> will probably get a stomachache from eating like this, you relent and do as he asks. Man, that boy really loves his sweets.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Luca" 1 1>>
<br>
<<include "School Lunch">>
<<set $FriendLunch to 1>>

:: OC Luca Eating With 3 [nobr]

/* Intro */
/* Requires: Friends with Carter as well */
Looking for a place to eat, you spot the candy-crazed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> along with your friend <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sitting at one of the nearby tables. <span style="color:yellow"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> looks absolutely devastated, head on the table with watery eyes as a concerned <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pats him on the back comfortingly. Confused about what happened, you walk over.</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Frown",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Carter",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Smile",
            Eyes: "Sad",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Luca",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Frown",
            Blush: 1,
            Eyes: "Sad",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, hey <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$CarterNickname</span>.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> says, giving you a nervous smile, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Care to join us? <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> could use some support right now.”</span> You ask what’s wrong and the sobbing boy sits up and pushes his lunchbox towards you. <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Take a look yourself!”</span> He replies, nearly wailing in despair. Confused, you open the lunchbox to find a perfectly normal packed lunch. Sandwich, some carrots, a juice, even a bag of chips. You don’t get what the- <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Not a single sweet! Not a chocolate, a muffin, even a taffy!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> slams his head on the table in utter sadness, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I thought mom loved me, but I’m going to waste away! What a cruel world!”</span> <span style="color:pink">As he continues to sob, you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> share a smirk. Only <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> would get this upset over a lack of sweets.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I didn’t eat my broccoli last night, because it’s disgusting, and she said no more sweets until I eat a full bowl. But I thought she was just kidding!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> slides his body under the table and curls up into a ball of depression. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I mean, spank me, ground me, strip me down and make me sleep in the doghouse. Anything is better than this!”</span> <br>
<br>
As the boy continues to sob, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sighs and relents, pulling a small candy bar out of his bag and holding it out in front of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>. The boy scrambles like a dog desperate for a treat once he sees it, getting on his knees and begging as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pulls it away. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“You can have this – IF – you eat everything else in your lunch. Sound fair?”</span> <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Carter",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Smile",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "OC Luca",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Uniform",
            Mouth: "Smile",
            Blush: 1,
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Can’t I just trade you my lunch for it? Please?”</span> The boy begs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Okay, then just a nibble, then I’ll eat my entire lunch! Please <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>! I’ll give you my underwear and bark like a dog, please just-!”</span> <span style="color:pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span> continues to beg and offer all sorts of desperate things in exchange for the candy. Everything from the clothes on his back to his freedom and unquestioning service for the next week. Thankfully for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Luca</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> isn’t the type to abuse that and eventually the obsessed boy relents to eating his lunch in order to get his sweet treat.</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Luca" 1 1>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
<br>
<<include "School Lunch">>
<<set $FriendLunch to 1>>
